        "description": "Pin Fashion is a block theme for fashion stores and clothing brands. It includes a Landing Page template built from patterns, with a hero banner, service features, outfit highlights and new arrivals. It also includes templates for blog posts and for WooCommerce shop, product, cart and checkout pages, plus four style variations. Every part of the site can be edited in the Site Editor."
